{"4572850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Orbital Express", "steam_appid": 4572850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and manage your own space company.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small operator launching basic satellites and grow into a dominant force in Earth's orbit. Take contracts, design missions, and expand your infrastructure across multiple orbital layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a decision. <br>Balance cost, success rate, and reward as you choose payloads and orbits. Will you play it safe, or risk everything for a bigger payout?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your satellite network grow and generate income over time. Expand from Low Earth Orbit (LEO) to Medium (MEO) and Geostationary Orbit (GEO), each with its own challenges and opportunities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and launch satellite missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your company finances and growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand across multiple orbital layers (LEO, MEO, GEO)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance risk, cost, and success rate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a growing network of income-generating satellites</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Your goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small. <br>Scale up. <br>Dominate Earth's orbit.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and manage your own space company.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a small operator launching basic satellites and grow into a dominant force in Earth's orbit. Take contracts, design missions, and expand your infrastructure across multiple orbital layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission is a decision. <br>Balance cost, success rate, and reward as you choose payloads and orbits. Will you play 